WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.650
<i>Where... am I?</i>

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.030
Hey!

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.910
Watch where you're going.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.120
Who is this scrubby girl?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.250
There is a slum nearby.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.090
Do you want this?

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:31.630
Oh? Then, here. Lick my shoe.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.840
Do that and it's yours.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:41.600
You little...

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.980
I like you, stray cat.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:46.600
What are you—

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:59.780
You have the courage to do whatever 
it takes to achieve your goal.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:03.370
I am in need of people like you.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.920
In need... of me?

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.710
I bet you'd shine with a little polishing.

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:10.380
What is your name?

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.710
Iltutmish.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.010
Seigi-kun, please run away!

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:23.100
She's an assassin from the Kingdom 
who's after your tattoo!

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.640
An assassin from the Kingdom?

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:25.890
But that's Touko!

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:27.980
You know her?

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:30.230
I am borrowing her body.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.980
I don't understand!

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:35.900
To be honest, I don't understand 
the situation I'm in now, either.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.200
But...

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.870
the thing I understand least 
is your way of doing things!

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:44.160
Is this what you call 
justice in your kingdom?!

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.750
Cut the crap!

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:47.420
Justice?

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:48.960
Seigi-kun!

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:52.460
In the box is a blood transfusion 
bag to use as your trigger!

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.420
Activate your tattoo with it!

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:58.010
A flesh-and-blood human 
can't beat a Sealed.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:01.640
Just avoid using Void Maker, 
whatever you do!

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.440
You're pissing me off!

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.230
Moving forward, eh?

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.860
Nice, nice...

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.110
Hide-and-seek this time, is it?

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.580
You've made two very big mistakes.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:30.080
The first was not killing me 
before my tattoo activated.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:35.050
The other was tearing up my 
brand new school uniform!

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:38.760
Over there?!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:55.400
Air trapped inside concrete by a tattoo 
becomes pressurized and explodes.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:58.860
An improvised grenade, huh? Little bitch...

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.410
Next time we meet, I'll kill you.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:35.000
Misery Loves Company

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.790
It's hard to move with this chest.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.340
It's not activating! Not enough blood?

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:43.720
Tom-san's blood!

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:47.050
Die.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:48.930
Sorry, can't do that.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.480
No handicaps from here on out.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:03.440
<i>I can see it...</i>

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:04.740
<i>But...</i>

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.950
<i>I can't get the right amount of force!</i>

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.170
Seigi-kun...

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.550
It seems there was no need 
to borrow this body.

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:24.420
Then get out of Touko right now!

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.090
You coward!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.300
Coward?

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.930
Wrong. This is justice.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.600
You asked what my idea of justice was.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.060
Justice is reason and law.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:41.690
Reason is defined by one's own beliefs,

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.150
and law is made law through power.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.280
And I carry that out using methods

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:50.120
that conform to the princess's philosophy.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.830
Thus, justice for me is to kill...

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.960
To kill you.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.960
Stop!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.670
Why do you have to do this?

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.710
You're the bad guy here, aren't you?

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:08.510
Seigi hates things that don't follow logic!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:09.930
This has...

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.060
nothing to do with you.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:15.890
Yes, it does!

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.600
Seigi is my hero,

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:20.610
and my...

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.030
M-My...

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.530
My p-prince!

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.280
A-Anyway...

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.620
Just get out of my body!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.580
What happened?

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:40.210
Now, Seigi-kun! Seize her now!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:41.580
I'll do the rest!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.000
Sorry, Touko!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.220
Good job, Seigi-kun.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:06.940
A Sealed with the power of possession...

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.280
I've heard of you.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.950
You're a member of the Kingdom's 
tattoo force, Brahman...

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.750
Nicknamed "Schrödinger's Cat."

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.540
That little girl is...

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:24.090
The lieutenant would scold me if I 
used such language in front of her,

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.460
Touko! Are you okay?

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.550
but I know the colonel would say...

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:26.250
Tou...

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.380
Your ass is—

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.260
S-Seigi-kun?

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:41.440
How dare you drag Touko into this?

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.850
You won't...

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:47.940
You won't...

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.450
You won't get away with that!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.240
No! You mustn't use Void Maker!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.330
You can blather all you want,

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.750
but there are some things 
it's not okay to do!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.420
"Justice is reason and law"?

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:06.790
Then I'm gonna devour your idea of justice!

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.170
I'll kill you first.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.760
Seigi! No!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:33.860
<i>Il, did you get the key?</i>

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.280
I haven't killed him yet.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:38.870
<i>Pull back, then.</i>

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.000
<i>Someone beyond your ability 
is headed your way.</i>

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.790
No. I won't be satisfied 
unless I kill him now.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.000
<i>Come on... If you don't do as I 
say, I'll tell the princess.</i>

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.630
I don't want that.

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.550
It appears she's retreated.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.470
What?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:02.980
That's odd.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:05.350
Gaping

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:06.060
I was sure my house was 
right around here...

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:07.940
Lieutenant!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.980
Did an assassin also find y—

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.530
<i>Hup...</i>

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.860
Tom! How can you expose 
your organ like that?!

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:15.820
This is why I always tell you not 
to get involved in shady talks

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.160
It's not that "organ"! 
They're internal organs!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.950
and dangerous deals.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.830
Shove it back inside right 
now! It's indecent!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.030
What was that back there, anyway?

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:22.620
That's easier said than done!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.290
You're going to explain all this to me.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.330
Sorry.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:28.330
You were fighting for my sake though, huh?

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.630
So I forgive you.

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.050
Sorry.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.330
I should've known.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.170
When you're an athletic type, you get 
used to being in drive much faster.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.920
But stop using only throws.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.420
It makes you too easy to read.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:20.760
I've never seen anyone beat Seigi 
other than his grandpa...

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:22.430
What's "drive"?

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:24.560
The state you're in while 
your tattoo is activated.

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.400
It went out...

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:34.860
Touko-san, we'll hide the tattoo with 
this sticker. Let me see your forehead.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:40.240
Ah, I'm sorry... Did that hurt?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.410
It's still a little swollen...

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.830
So this tattoo won't come off?

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.500
It's not just any tattoo.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:52.000
A copy like mine can be removed, but...

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.920
Huh? You can take them off?!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.380
Oh, it doesn't work for yours, Seigi-kun.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:11:00.050
Mine is known as a "copy."

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:03.470
It's a byproduct of the research process 
that resulted in the original.

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:06.600
It doesn't take root, so it can be removed,

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.390
but its capabilities are low.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.900
A copy tattoo can only act

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:14.020
as a noise canceler that negates 
supernatural phenomena

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.570
generated by other tattoos.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.030
So is Izzy's...

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:20.860
Mine is an original.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:23.740
It's not as special as yours, though.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.160
Then what about Touko's?

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.080
I've never seen one like this.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.710
The range in which

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.630
a tattoo's power can 
manifest is very limited.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:37.300
And it's hard to believe that last Sealed

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:39.970
stayed within that range the 
whole time to use it...

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:42.640
Still, its pattern is indeed hers.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.140
I just don't get it.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:50.140
The mechanisms of tattoos are still 
being researched, after all.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:55.360
How could anyone try to use these 
without understanding the logic?

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.480
You used its power

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:01.450
without understanding the 
logic or consequences.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.740
Well, I just went into a rage...

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:08.450
I never thought it would end up like that.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.960
Come here and look at this.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.080
What, what? What is that?

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:17.670
This is the test subject 
in a failed experiment

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.710
to attach a triggerless tattoo.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.220
Don't look!

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.930
Void Maker went berserk.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:30.180
See how it bored so easily 
through flesh and bone alike?

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.690
The void swallows everything,

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.610
with no distinction between yourself

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.980
and others, living and nonliving.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:42.950
And there's no way to defend against it.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:48.660
When you used it,

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.620
you probably came close to vanishing without

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.250
leaving any trace, or drop of blood.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:58.840
Could you accept something 
like that happening?

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:06.010
That thing is extremely dangerous.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.180
Promise me that you won't use 
it without my permission.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.060
I promise.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.810
Okay, let's continue our lesson.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.520
The boost you gain by activating the tattoo is

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.740
proportionate to your
ability in your normal state.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:26.240
To give an extreme example, 
the world's fastest runner

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.820
would be the fastest of all Sealed, too.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.410
The world's strongest person

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.080
would be the strongest Sealed.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.960
So you're saying to improve my 
base physical abilities, right?

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:36.540
Right.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:39.330
So now you're going to run ten kilometers.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:42.250
Sure! If it'll make me 
stronger, I'll do anything!

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:43.960
One moment.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.760
I need to give these to you and Touko-san.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.130
What's this?

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.340
It's sort of like a protective charm.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.890
It's a device that detects 
tattoo activation.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:56.390
If there's anyone in your vicinity who's 
activated a tattoo, it will sound an alert.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.190
It will also send your location to

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.230
Tom's and my cell phones.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:04.440
Even if a Sealed attacks you, 
we'll be right there to help.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:07.450
So it's like a personal alarm.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.990
Okay, I'm heading out!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:12.330
Don't go into deserted areas just 
because you have protection now!

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:13.200
I know!

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.370
We'll be going now.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.700
Take care.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.330
Still...

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:23.460
Between this lack of chaos immediately 
following a coup d'état

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.170
and the actions of Brahman...

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:29.930
It looks like several arrangements 
were made in advance.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:33.760
Yeah...

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.850
But our biggest concern right now is,

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:41.230
where did the Kingdom get its 
information about Seigi-kun?

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.520
I did some searching,

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.570
but found no signs of an information leak.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.400
Which means

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:52.490
the only plausible reason is because 
he used his ability then.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:55.910
Lieutenant.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:00.000
I propose that we take him back 
to America for safekeeping.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:05.050
We must not let the Kingdom 
take the triggerless tattoo.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.880
But the two of us

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.840
cannot protect him alone.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.680
I'm going to take a shower.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.770
Lieutenant!

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:20.230
Give me some time.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.530
I'm sorry. This is my fault.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.070
Why are you apologizing?

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.700
It's not your fault, Seigi.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:40.290
Touko, we're caught up in some 
really nasty stuff now.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.000
No...

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:51.930
I think I just don't understand it yet.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.510
Anyway, I'm sorry.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:01.940
I'm kind of glad I get to share

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.400
a secret with you, though.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:07.480
A secret just between the two of 
us sounds kind of romantic.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.900
Huh? Say what?

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:09.320
Ba-dump

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:11.700
Well, come on! 
Quit standing around and run!

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:12.530
H-Hey!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.660
What happened, Touko?

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:18.410
That scared me...

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.160
The hell's your problem?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.160
So I'm a stray cat with a fish in my mouth. Sue me.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:23.620
The hell?

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:25.420
The hell's your problem?

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.380
Huh? You wanna fight?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.010
Looks like a den of stray cats.

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:33.760
The kittens are cute...

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.640
Get outta here! Imma mess you up, bitch!

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.430
It's really true.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:47.360
The strong have to protect the weak.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.730
I won't let you end up in danger anymore.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:54.700
I'll get stronger and protect you.

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:00.660
Seigi, you sound cooler than usual...

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.160
Hey, wait!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:03.790
Hurry up!

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.250
He's a little dreamer, ain't he?

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.590
He is also young and prideful.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.010
Are you in any place to talk?

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.390
You want to let the triggerless 
tattoo get away?

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.350
Slow down, Touko! You're going too fast!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:20.760
I think we should just keep 
him close for a while.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:24.350
It looks like they're hiding him from 
their buddies in the US Army, too.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.860
We'll put him under observation. 
No need to worry.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:30.980
Oh?

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.570
Well, that's reality for you.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.490
You've gotta get rid of

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:39.070
the ones you can't provide for.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.920
Very good!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.170
Hyperbolic! Hyperbolic!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.630
Wow, Izzy, you look just like a doll!

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.260
You're so cute!

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.010
Come on, Lisa...

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:59.010
I asked you to help me pick out clothes,

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.850
but nothing this childish...

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:03.020
You know you like it!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:06.730
Besides, if you call yourself an 
adult, you should be saying,

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:10.650
"I'm not small at all!" Go on, say it.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:11.860
Come on, Izzy!

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.940
Izzy-tan! Izzy-tan!

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:17.570
I am not small!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.450
Cafe Albatross

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:21.160
Oh, come on. Stop being mad already.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:24.830
I'm not.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.170
Secret File

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.170
Here.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:31.000
Information on our next target.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.420
Thanks, as always.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:36.720
We still can't get our hands 
on that scum, Wiseman, though.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:38.430
By the way, Izzy,

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.350
why do you think you guys 
were targeted this time?

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.470
No idea.

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:48.440
It looks like some kids have been going 
in and out of your place lately.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.770
I have no interest in kids.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:53.690
They're just friends. Online game buddies.

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.200
Since the princess took over the Kingdom

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.240
after the recent coup d'état,

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:01.950
things are on the move.

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:05.790
It's already been decided that America will 
send additional forces for the tattoo case.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.750
We need to share as much strategical

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.380
information as possible right now.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.710
You look like a little girl 
being scolded by her parents.

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:15.500
That's not like you.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:19.970
It's not like I want to pry, and I 
doubt you'd listen to me anyway,

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:21.470
but if there's anything shady going on,

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:24.140
spill it before you get hurt.

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:26.890
Don't forget you're in the army.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:27.520
Ow!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.980
Okay, enough formal talk!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.480
Hey, more cake, please!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:34.060
What? It's not free?

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.860
But coffee refills are free!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:38.650
You're gonna lose customers with 
a stingy policy like that!

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:42.030
Come on, give me a little service here!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.030
You're being shameless.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:36.350
Come on...

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:39.650
I'm going to clean you up, so stay still...

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:44.990
Hey! Stop struggling!

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:47.450
See how quiet Mickey is being?

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:52.910
Cut it out or I will wring your neck.

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:57.420
Oh... You're...

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.040
a boy?

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:06.800
Yeah. Yeah.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:08.470
Right.

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:10.300
Got it, Deputy Captain.

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:17.480
Medicine

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:27.240
Shut that thing up!

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:31.320
Complain to him, not me.

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.080
Ow!

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:34.740
Damn you, Il!

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:35.790
Got you.

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:38.210
Complain to him, not me.

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:40.540
Also, you should've been 
able to dodge that.

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:43.300
How old are you again?

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:44.890
I don't remember.

00:22:45.910 --> 00:22:48.210
Are you into that kind of thing?

00:22:48.710 --> 00:22:50.800
Try anything funny and I'll kill you.

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:54.250
Nah, a body like that 
isn't gonna turn me on.

00:22:54.750 --> 00:22:56.170
More importantly, there.

00:22:58.630 --> 00:22:59.880
It's arrived.

00:23:04.180 --> 00:23:05.390
The new one...

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:10.020
I just spoke to the deputy captain.

00:23:13.020 --> 00:23:15.150
For the moment, we prioritize 
the elimination of

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:18.150
the American forces connected 
to the tattoos.

00:23:19.650 --> 00:23:22.070
This is our next target.

00:23:40.760 --> 00:23:41.720
An enemy attack?!

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:44.470
You're Schrödinger's Cat, aren't you?

00:23:44.930 --> 00:23:47.600
Don't think you'll get to 
leave here in one piece!

00:23:47.930 --> 00:23:48.980
Blow away!

00:23:50.560 --> 00:23:52.560
Well, this is a problem...

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.080
Distance

00:23:52.980 --> 00:23:54.360
Sorry, Izzy.
